{"title":"2023 IOQM/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IOQM/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let α and β be <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive_integers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Positive integers\">positive integers</a> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/a/c5a37c4a86d6246fea22dacdffada434f87c22a5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{16}{37}&lt;\\frac{\\alpha}{\\beta}&lt;\\frac{7}{16}\\]\" width=\"105\" height=\"41\" />\nFind the smallest possible value of β .\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IOQM/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First reciprocal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/4/534ee2a80f669ef3970f93962fd594eec92e046b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\alpha}{\\beta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"18\" height=\"38\" /> to get a smaller number, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/5/935fa63d0ae2afaa5f85c559ec4e8bd00be3b7f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{16}{7}&lt;\\frac{\\beta}{\\alpha}&lt;\\frac{37}{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"110\" height=\"39\" />. This gives ,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/b/51b592b7b82decde47fe6bcd3dcea85d49c3dab6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{16\\alpha}{7}&lt;\\beta&lt;\\frac{37\\alpha}{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"129\" height=\"38\" />. Now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/3/7232addca559833f4c0fc0dd2659a9e9d12c622d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{16\\alpha}{7}\\approx 2.28\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"104\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/1/6b153293f5041d5db1cbc519c0f63334bd6587d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{37\\alpha}{16} \\approx 2.31\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"104\" height=\"38\" />. So we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/7/737f87c373428eb378bef58f7d22cc67a551650c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.28\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;2.31\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"18\" />. To make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/b/fdb63b9e51abe6bbb16acfb5d7b773ddbb5bf4a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\beta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"16\" /> minimum we can put <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/9/6e9c3b4c3a09026689f29ccbb9467054c8f2a0cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/a/0daa21bfdf77560d9b07dacc91ba454081372e29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22.8&lt;\\beta&lt;23.1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" />. This gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/d/a2d3515115c65fdb1ca077da8da324011bf4ac4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\beta=23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"67\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018065130\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 41/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2197/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:25353:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018065130 and revision id 256949. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}